OL,3,GNEWSAHospital photo project 'healing'
OL,4,Afor ex patient
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Being back for this photography
OL,7,Fproject was at times very difficult but
OL,8,Fhas also been very healing."
OL,10,FPhotographer Ciara Hillyer spent much
OL,11,Fof her childhood at the Bristol
OL,12,FChildren's Hospital after being
OL,13,Fdiagnosed with cystic fibrosis when she
OL,14,Fwas just five days old.
OL,16,FNow aged 33, she has returned to create
OL,17,Fthree exhibitions to mark 25 years
OL,18,Fsince the hospital was opened.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
