OL,3,GNEWSAHospital photo project 'healing'
OL,4,Afor ex patient
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former patient, who became the
OL,7,Ffirst face of the charity drive by the
OL,8,FGrand Appeal to fund the hospital, said
OL,9,Fit had been "emotional" photographing
OL,10,Fstaff - including a doctor and nurse
OL,11,Fwho cared for her.
